cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this theoretical/methods preprint or its synthetic verifier, please cite it."
title: "Rate-Distortion Immunology: Defragmenting the Aging Immune Repertoire"
abstract: >-
  A prior-sensitive, safety-constrained framework for estimating gaps in T-cell
  recognition coverage under a fixed representational budget. Includes a formal
  submodular baseline, synthetic numerical verification, and a preregistered
  plan for future public-data evaluation. No human cohort was analyzed.
